{
 "Чему равен периметр ADFI?": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='-9 -9 96 80' role='img' aria-label='Рисунок условия: прямоугольник ADFI с квадратом HIJK и наклонной KL'><path fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='0.6' d='M0 0H78V60H0Z'/><path fill='none' stroke='#cfdae6' stroke-width='0.45' d='M21 0V60M57 0V60M0 21H21M57 36H78M21 21L57 36'/><g fill='#cfdae6'><circle cx='0' cy='0' r='0.9'/><circle cx='21' cy='0' r='0.9'/><circle cx='57' cy='0' r='0.9'/><circle cx='78' cy='0' r='0.9'/><circle cx='0' cy='21' r='0.9'/><circle cx='21' cy='21' r='0.9'/><circle cx='57' cy='36' r='0.9'/><circle cx='78' cy='36' r='0.9'/><circle cx='0' cy='60' r='0.9'/><circle cx='21' cy='60' r='0.9'/><circle cx='57' cy='60' r='0.9'/><circle cx='78' cy='60' r='0.9'/></g><g fill='#e8eef6' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='-3.5' y='-2.5'>I</text><text x='21' y='-2.5'>H</text><text x='57' y='-2.5'>G</text><text x='81.5' y='-2.5'>F</text><text x='-3.8' y='22.3'>J</text><text x='24.5' y='19.5'>K</text><text x='54' y='33'>L</text><text x='81.8' y='37.3'>E</text><text x='-3.5' y='65'>A</text><text x='21' y='65.5'>B</text><text x='57' y='65.5'>C</text><text x='81.5' y='65'>D</text></g></svg><figcaption>Рисунок из условия. Внизу на одной прямой A, B, C, D; наверху I, H, G, F. HB и GC — вертикали. JK отрезает сверху квадрат HIJK, LE — горизонталь в правой полосе, KL — наклонный отрезок.</figcaption></figure>",
 "HK + KL = a + (h − a) = h": "<figure class='st fx'><svg viewBox='-14 -9 106 88' role='img' aria-label='Отрезок AJ переезжает на место наклонной KL'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6' d='M0 0H78V60H0Z'/><path fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.45' d='M21 0V60M57 0V60M0 21H21M57 36H78M21 21L57 36'/><g fill='#4a5866'><circle cx='0' cy='0' r='0.9'/><circle cx='21' cy='0' r='0.9'/><circle cx='57' cy='0' r='0.9'/><circle cx='78' cy='0' r='0.9'/><circle cx='0' cy='21' r='0.9'/><circle cx='21' cy='21' r='0.9'/><circle cx='57' cy='36' r='0.9'/><circle cx='78' cy='36' r='0.9'/><circle cx='0' cy='60' r='0.9'/><circle cx='21' cy='60' r='0.9'/><circle cx='57' cy='60' r='0.9'/><circle cx='78' cy='60' r='0.9'/></g><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='-3.5' y='-2.5'>I</text><text x='21' y='-2.5'>H</text><text x='57' y='-2.5'>G</text><text x='81.5' y='-2.5'>F</text><text x='-3.8' y='22.3'>J</text><text x='24.5' y='19.5'>K</text><text x='54' y='33'>L</text><text x='81.8' y='37.3'>E</text><text x='-3.5' y='65'>A</text><text x='21' y='65.5'>B</text><text x='57' y='65.5'>C</text><text x='81.5' y='65'>D</text></g><text x='10.5' y='4.5' fill='#b8c4d2' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>a</text><text x='-3.2' y='11.5' fill='#b8c4d2' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>a</text><text x='10.5' y='19.5' fill='#b8c4d2' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>a</text><text x='10.5' y='58' fill='#b8c4d2' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>a</text><text x='67.5' y='58' fill='#b8c4d2' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>a</text><text x='67.5' y='4.5' fill='#b8c4d2' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>a</text><text x='67.5' y='34' fill='#b8c4d2' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>a</text><text x='39' y='4.5' fill='#b8c4d2' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>m</text><text x='39' y='58' fill='#b8c4d2' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>m</text><text x='60.5' y='19' fill='#b8c4d2' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>m</text><text x='74.5' y='19' fill='#b8c4d2' font-size='3.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>m</text><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.3s;--dur:0.9s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' d='M0 21L0 60'/><text x='-5.5' y='42' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.1s'>h − a</text><path class='sl' style='--d:1.8s;--to:translate(1.615px,12.923px) rotate(-67.38deg)' fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' stroke-linecap='round' d='M0 21L0 60'/><text x='35' y='36' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:3.2s'>h − a</text><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:3.6s;--dur:0.7s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' d='M21 0L21 21'/><text x='39' y='74' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='4.0' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:4.3s'>HK + KL = a + (h − a) = h</text></svg><figcaption>Буквы a и m стоят на всех отрезках, которые им равны. Наклонную KL по рисунку не измерить, но по условию она равна AJ — а AJ это вся высота без стороны квадрата. Вместе со стороной квадрата HK наклонная даёт ровно высоту h.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Шаг 1 — план: обойти четыре спрошенных контура": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -8 112 80' role='img' aria-label='Периметр EFHKL'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6' d='M0 0H78V60H0Z'/><path fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.45' d='M21 0V60M57 0V60M0 21H21M57 36H78M21 21L57 36'/><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='-3.5' y='-2.5'>I</text><text x='21' y='-2.5'>H</text><text x='57' y='-2.5'>G</text><text x='81.5' y='-2.5'>F</text><text x='-3.8' y='22.3'>J</text><text x='24.5' y='19.5'>K</text><text x='54' y='33'>L</text><text x='81.8' y='37.3'>E</text><text x='-3.5' y='65'>A</text><text x='21' y='65.5'>B</text><text x='57' y='65.5'>C</text><text x='81.5' y='65'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.0s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M78 36L78 0L21 0L21 21L57 36Z'/><text x='84.5' y='19' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>m</text><text x='39' y='-3' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.35s'>a + m</text><text x='16.5' y='12' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.9s'>a</text><text x='39' y='34.5' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.45s'>h − a</text><text x='67.5' y='33.5' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:3.0s'>a</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(EFHKL)</b> = m + (a + m) + a + (h − a) + a</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -8 112 80' role='img' aria-label='Периметр BDELK'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6' d='M0 0H78V60H0Z'/><path fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.45' d='M21 0V60M57 0V60M0 21H21M57 36H78M21 21L57 36'/><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='-3.5' y='-2.5'>I</text><text x='21' y='-2.5'>H</text><text x='57' y='-2.5'>G</text><text x='81.5' y='-2.5'>F</text><text x='-3.8' y='22.3'>J</text><text x='24.5' y='19.5'>K</text><text x='54' y='33'>L</text><text x='81.8' y='37.3'>E</text><text x='-3.5' y='65'>A</text><text x='21' y='65.5'>B</text><text x='57' y='65.5'>C</text><text x='81.5' y='65'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.0s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M21 60L78 60L78 36L57 36L21 21Z'/><text x='49.5' y='69.5' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>m + a</text><text x='86' y='49' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.35s'>h − m</text><text x='67.5' y='33.5' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.9s'>a</text><text x='37' y='24' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.45s'>h − a</text><text x='13' y='42' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:3.0s'>h − a</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(BDELK)</b> = (m + a) + (h − m) + a + (h − a) + (h − a)</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -8 112 80' role='img' aria-label='Периметр BCLK'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6' d='M0 0H78V60H0Z'/><path fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.45' d='M21 0V60M57 0V60M0 21H21M57 36H78M21 21L57 36'/><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='-3.5' y='-2.5'>I</text><text x='21' y='-2.5'>H</text><text x='57' y='-2.5'>G</text><text x='81.5' y='-2.5'>F</text><text x='-3.8' y='22.3'>J</text><text x='24.5' y='19.5'>K</text><text x='54' y='33'>L</text><text x='81.8' y='37.3'>E</text><text x='-3.5' y='65'>A</text><text x='21' y='65.5'>B</text><text x='57' y='65.5'>C</text><text x='81.5' y='65'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.0s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M21 60L57 60L57 36L21 21Z'/><text x='39' y='69.5' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>m</text><text x='64' y='49' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.35s'>h − m</text><text x='37' y='24' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.9s'>h − a</text><text x='13' y='42' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:2.45s'>h − a</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(BCLK)</b> = m + (h − m) + (h − a) + (h − a)</p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-16 -8 112 80' role='img' aria-label='Периметр ADFI'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.6' d='M0 0H78V60H0Z'/><path fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.45' d='M21 0V60M57 0V60M0 21H21M57 36H78M21 21L57 36'/><g fill='#93a1b1' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'><text x='-3.5' y='-2.5'>I</text><text x='21' y='-2.5'>H</text><text x='57' y='-2.5'>G</text><text x='81.5' y='-2.5'>F</text><text x='-3.8' y='22.3'>J</text><text x='24.5' y='19.5'>K</text><text x='54' y='33'>L</text><text x='81.8' y='37.3'>E</text><text x='-3.5' y='65'>A</text><text x='21' y='65.5'>B</text><text x='57' y='65.5'>C</text><text x='81.5' y='65'>D</text></g><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.0s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.35' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 60L78 60L78 0L0 0Z'/><text x='39' y='69.5' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:0.8s'>a + m + a</text><text x='-7.5' y='31' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600' class='fi' style='--d:1.35s'>h</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(ADFI)</b> = 2·((a + m + a) + h)</p></div></div><figcaption>Четыре спрошенных контура — четыре обхода по одному чертежу. Наклонная KL входит в три контура из четырёх и везде стоит как h − a. В EFHKL внутренняя сторона GL не обходится: верх идёт от F до H целиком.</figcaption></figure>"
}